{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">DB-REMOTE-HOST function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309239","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DB-REMOTE-HOST-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DB-REMOTE-HOST-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"DB-REMOTE-HOST-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">DB-REMOTE-HOST function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a character string containing the IP address of the database connection. The IP\n        address format is determined by the Internet Protocol used when the connection was\n        established. A single input parameter identifies the database, which can be either the\n        logical database name or database number. If the database is not connected using TCP/IP or\n        the <code class=\"ph codeph\">-ipver IPv6</code> startup parameter is not used, the function returns the\n        Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DB-REMOTE-HOST-function__syntax_GC15DC2684982\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d118969e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"DB-REMOTE-HOST-function__idGDH24A2665413\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DB-REMOTE-HOST ( <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong><var class=\"keyword varname\">logical-name</var><em class=\"ph i\"><em class=\"ph i\"><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong></em></em><var class=\"keyword varname\">integer-expression</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">logical-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A character expression specifying the logical name of a connected database.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">integer-expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The sequence number of a connected database. For example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">DB-REMOTE-HOST(1)</code> returns\ninformation on the first connected database, <code class=\"ph codeph\">DB-REMOTE-HOST(2)</code> returns\ninformation on the second connected database, and so on.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DB-REMOTE-HOST-function__notes_GC15DD2684995\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d118969e174\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">For more\ninformation on the Internet Protocol (IP) version (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-ipver</code>)\nstartup parameter, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Deployment: Startup Command\nand Parameter Reference</cite>.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DB-REMOTE-HOST-function__see-also_GC15DE2685002\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d118969e189\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"REMOTE-HOST-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/REMOTE-HOST-attribute.html\">REMOTE-HOST attribute</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBPARAM-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBPARAM-function.html\">DBPARAM function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBRESTRICTIONS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBRESTRICTIONS-function.html\">DBRESTRICTIONS function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309239","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"DB-REMOTE-HOST function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DB-REMOTE-HOST-function.html","type":"Manual"}